Open auto
; OpenPrefs desktop profile (OpenLook 0.4's prefs format, with "target" lines).
; Modern: the Open theme, dark in the evening, everything drawn.
target amigachrome
mode auto 19 7
lite off
screen workbench themed
screen public themed
screen custom classic
; the approved look (OpenLook 0.5): no zoom or size gadget, scroll bars only when needed
zoom off
sizegadget off
scrollers auto
